---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
---
{% from "components.njk" import storyCard %}
{% set featured = contentData.featured %}
{% set featuredSeries = contentData.seriesBySlug[featured.seriesSlug] %}
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">故事 × 术语 × 实例</p><h1>用场景故事，<br>读懂投资与保障。</h1><p class="hero-lead">给有一点投资经验的你：从工资、房子与市场的日常选择出发，把金融概念讲成人话。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#start">先读这一篇</a><a class="button secondary" href="{{ '/terms/' | url }}">浏览术语索引</a></div></div><aside class="hero-note"><strong>不是先背定义，而是先听故事。</strong><p>在熟悉的情境里遇见概念，用白话表格拆清机制，再回到实际例子。</p><span class="small">{{ contentData.series | length }} 个场景 · {{ contentData.stories | length }} 篇可读 · {{ contentData.previewCount }} 篇预告</span></aside></div></section>
<section class="section container" id="series"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">可读场景</p><h2>从你正在经历的事读起</h2></div><span class="small">可读 {{ contentData.stories | length }} 篇 · 预告 {{ (contentData.allStories | length) - (contentData.stories | length) }} 篇</span></div><div class="series-grid">{% for series in contentData.readableSeries %}<article class="series-card"><div class="card-kicker"><div class="series-order">{{ '%02d' | format(series.order) }}</div>{% if series.format == 'brief' %}<span class="format-badge">理念</span>{% endif %}</div><h3><a href="{{ ('/series/' + series.slug + '/') | url }}">{{ series.title }}</a></h3><p>{{ series.summary }}</p><div class="card-bottom"><span>{% set k = (series.stories | length) - (series.publishedStories | length) %}{% if series.publishedStories.length %}{{ series.publishedStories | length }} 篇{{ '理念' if series.format == 'brief' else '可读' }}{% endif %}{% if series.publishedStories.length and k %} · {% endif %}{% if k %}{{ k }} 篇预告{% endif %}</span><a href="{{ ('/series/' + series.slug + '/') | url }}" aria-label="进入{{ series.title }}系列">进入 →</a></div></article>{% endfor %}</div>{% if contentData.preparingSeries.length %}<aside class="preparing-block"><h2>筹备中：{% for series in contentData.preparingSeries %}{{ series.title }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</h2><p>这些场景还没有可读正文，先不做成空卡片。</p></aside>{% endif %}</section>
<section class="section container"><div class="tag-shortcuts"><span class="filter-label">从知识域快速进入</span>{% for tag in taxonomy.axes.tags.items %}{% if tag.id in contentData.coverage.tags %}<a class="chip" href="{{ '/terms/' | url }}?tag={{ tag.id | urlencode }}">{{ tag.id }} →</a>{% elif tag.id == '保险' %}<span class="chip is-preparing" aria-disabled="true">保障专题 · 筹备中</span>{% else %}<span class="chip is-preparing" aria-disabled="true">{{ tag.id }} · 筹备中</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="section container" id="start"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">先读这一篇</p><h2>{{ featured.title }}</h2></div><span class="small">约 {{ featured.readingMinutes }} 分钟</span></div><article class="story-card featured-pick"><div class="card-meta">{% if featured.format == 'brief' %}<span class="format-badge">理念</span>{% endif %}<a class="scene-chip" href="{{ ('/series/' + featured.seriesSlug + '/') | url }}">{{ featuredSeries.title }}</a><span class="level level-{{ featured.level }}"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span> {{ {'L1':'入门','L2':'进阶','L3':'精读'}[featured.level] }}</span></div><p>{{ featured.hook }}</p><a class="button" href="{{ featured.url | url }}">开始阅读</a></article>{% if contentData.continueReads.length %}<div class="continue-reads"><h3>续读</h3><div class="story-list featured">{% for story in contentData.continueReads %}{{ storyCard(story, contentData.series) }}{% endfor %}</div></div>{% endif %}</section>
